@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #43546B
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title Use case diagram — proposed MVP
left to right direction
actor Analyst
actor Manager
actor Administrator
Manager --|> Analyst
rectangle "Intelligent CRM Platform" {
 usecase "Manage accessible\ncustomer records" as Customers
 usecase "Capture text\ninteraction" as Capture
 usecase "Request analysis" as Analyse
 usecase "Validate input" as Validate
 usecase "Review analysis" as Review
 usecase "Inspect source turns" as Inspect
 usecase "Edit reviewed summary" as Edit
 usecase "Export accessible\nrecords" as Export
 usecase "Manage users and roles" as Access
}
Analyst --> Customers
Analyst --> Capture
Analyst --> Analyse
Analyst --> Review
Analyst --> Export
Administrator --> Access
Capture ..> Validate : <<include>>
Analyse ..> Validate : <<include>>
Review ..> Inspect : <<include>>
Edit ..> Review : <<extend>>\nbefore approval/rejection
note bottom of Review
Precondition: authenticated and authorised.
Approval/rejection is a human action.
end note
@enduml
